# The build context is this directory, and the two Python leaves in it are
# imported by host-side tests — `docker/devbox/scripts/istota-exec-serve`
# resolves its protocol module out of `lib/` when it runs from a checkout. So a
# test run leaves `__pycache__/` here, which would otherwise go into the build
# context, change its digest, and be COPYable into the image.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
